OL,3,GNEWSAParents march against possible
OL,4,Aschool closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents and pupils have marched to
OL,7,Fcouncil offices to protest against
OL,8,Fproposals which could see the closure
OL,9,Fof their primary school.
OL,11,FBrookvale Primary, in Runcorn,
OL,12,FCheshire, is one of three schools being
OL,13,Fconsidered as part of a consultation on
OL,14,Fpossible mergers, federations or
OL,15,Fclosures.
OL,17,FParent Claire Watts said the school had
OL,18,Fbeen "the heart of the community" for
OL,19,F53 years and she would have to leave
OL,20,Fher job if it closed, because of the
OL,21,Fdifficulty of getting her children to
OL,22,Fanother school.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
