OL,3,GNEWSAParents march against possible
OL,4,Aschool closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FHalton Borough Council said Runcorn had
OL,7,F1,279 more primary school places than
OL,8,Fchildren and the gap was expected to
OL,9,Fwiden, but stressed no decisions had
OL,10,Fbeen made.
